---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// Update this date whenever you edit the page.
const updated = new Date('2026-09-24');
---

<BaseLayout title="Now" description="What I'm focused on right now">
  <h1>Now</h1>
  <p class="meta">
    Last updated{' '}
    {updated.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })} from
    my home in Istanbul
  </p>

  <h2>I decided to open this blog</h2>
  <p>
    I always wanted to create a blog page for myself but for some reason the effort felt rather big.
    But today is different, because I have been really sick for 2 days I didn't do anything but
    sleep. And right now I am little bit better. I'm well enough to get out of bed, but I'm not in
    any condition to go outside. So to keep me entartained I decided to finally start creating my
    personal blog.
  </p>

  <br />

  <h2>I realized that (despite AI usage) Web is still fun to learn</h2>
  <p>
    I will write a blog post about how I started to like Web, Browsers, JavaScript etc. But for now
    I can say that I want to deepen my knowledge in these fields and hopefully create something
    meaningful which can be used by people.
  </p>

  <br />

  <h2>Just for Fun: The Story of an Accidental Revolutionary</h2>
  <p>
    I started to read this book by Linus Torvalds. It was sitting in my backlog for a really long
    time but it was really hard to find a hard copy of this book. One day while looking at second
    hand platforms I saw this book which was in okay condition so I decided to buy it and now
    reading it.
  </p>

  <br />

  <h2>Bursa</h2>
  <p>
    I went to Bursa with my friends. And it was really great. It was like a daily trip so I feel
    like I just scratched the surface of it and will definetly go there again.
  </p>

  <p class="meta">
    This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">now page</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
